<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending grows 3.4 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending grows 3.4 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending grew 3.4 percent year-on-year in February, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  Feb 1997	Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +3.4%	   +2.9%(r)	+3.0%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +3.8%	   +3.5%(r)	+7.3%</p>
<p>Deposits		+2.1%	   +3.4%(r)	+2.0%</p>
</text>
